  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analysis and Promotion of UK-Malawi Trade Opportunities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK-Malawi Trade Opportunities Programme is an FCDO initiative to boost bilateral trade by identifying export opportunities, addressing trade barriers, and facilitating business links under the UK&#x2019;s Developing Countries Trading Scheme.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the UK-Malawi Trade Opportunities Programme are to:

Understand current trade between the UK and Malawi.
Identify the main challenges stopping Malawi from exporting more to the UK.
Find the best products and sectors in Malawi to export to the UK.
Help connect Malawian exporters with UK importers.
Create a simple guide to help Malawian businesses export to the UK.
Share the findings with businesses and policymakers in both countries.</narrative>
  </description>
